DPDV-20057: dataset-go sends the API token in the Authorization header, not in
the addEvents body, so TestConsumeLogsShouldSucceed must stop expecting
AuthParams.Token in the decoded body and check the header instead.

Upstream: not opened yet; it belongs in the Renovate PR that bumps dataset-go
to the release containing DPDV-20057. Delete this file once that is merged.

